        "original_id": "4cd00562-6ee4-51f7-8bc4-ad78b0b6290b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: CamCutter, FieldPack\n- Companies: Ikegami\n- Events: National Association of Broadcasters convention\n- Places: Las Vegas, Las Vegas Strip, Paradise, Winchester\n- Topics: tape transport units\n\nFacts:\n- CamCutter was first revealed in 1995 at the National Association of Broadcasters convention in Las Vegas.\n- CamCutter used a camera mechanism made by Ikegami.\n- CamCutter used a special FieldPack unit instead of a tape transport unit.\n- The Las Vegas Strip is approximately 4.2 miles long.\n- The Las Vegas Strip is located immediately south of the Las Vegas city limits in the unincorporated towns of Paradise and Winchester.",
